00:12:54.110 --> 00:13:00.380
Traveling through the sky with the cold moon

00:13:01.220 --> 00:13:04.710
Speak softly of

00:13:04.710 --> 00:13:11.830
the unspeakable yearnings

00:13:11.830 --> 00:13:15.470
Let the memories

00:13:15.470 --> 00:13:22.130
gets frozen as poems in the long night

00:13:22.450 --> 00:13:26.440
Let everything

00:13:26.440 --> 00:13:33.020
sunk faintly into silence

00:13:43.580 --> 00:13:47.650
while still carry

00:13:47.650 --> 00:13:53.900
the longing for the light

00:14:04.760 --> 00:14:08.640
is hope

00:14:09.130 --> 00:14:14.710
is metamorphosis
